# Rev C changes against the rev B files stored in claude/code/hippos/legs_v3b/ (2026-11-20).
# 1. hippos_legs_cad.py: apply the unified diff at the end (patch -p0 < this file after cutting the header).
# 2. legs_cad_verify.py, RUN list: replace ("shoulder belt", "pulley 54T") with ("shoulder belt", "shoulder pulley"), ("shoulder belt", "belt idler").
# 3. legs_motion.py: ACTS knee front "RobStride 04", ratio front 22 / 46; 'eff = S.BELT_EFF if ratio != 1 else 1.0' (was ratio > 1).
# 4. legs_v3_study.py: the three 'eff = BELT_EFF if ratio > 1 else 1.0' lines become 'ratio != 1'.
# 5. legs_motion_test.py: spd_lim fore joint = w_free(M.ACTS["knee"]["front"]) / M.ACTS["ratio"]["front"] (was / 1.5); shoulder_belt_peak_N = pk("front") / (C.FORE.mech["belt"]["r_joint"] / 1e3) (was C.pd(54) / 2e3).
# 6. agility.py: SPD fore q1 = W_FREE(M.ACTS["knee"]["front"]) / M.ACTS["ratio"]["front"] (was W_FREE("RobStride 06") / 1.5); in leap_loads 'S.BELT_EFF if ratio != 1' (was ratio > 1).
# 7. sprint_addon.py: one call for both voltages: A.sprint_jump(tries=((1.8, 0.8), (2.0, 0.8), (1.8, 0.9), (2.2, 0.8), (2.0, 0.9))).
# 8. viewer titles: rev B -> rev C.

